\ A three-deep user chain above an interpreted prelude subtree. Under eager, `say` and
\ `report` are compiled rows contributed during the unwind, above the boundary at
\ `print-line`; `relay` is tail-elided at the top level on both tiers. No flags: one golden
\ binds the interpreted suite, the eager suite, and the AOT `.source` redirect, so every
\ compiled row above the interpreted subtree is pinned.

say:    ( v -- ) [ print-line 0 drop ] ;
report: ( v -- ) [ say 0 drop ] ;
relay:  ( v -- ) [ report 0 drop ] ;

42 relay
